  "A single command: curl the install.sh and you're done. Nothing to clone, no packages to pick by hand, nothing to fix afterwards.": "Un sol comandament: baixa l'install.sh amb curl i ja est\u00e0. No res a clonar, cap paquet per triar a m\u00e0, res a arreglar despr\u00e9s.",
  "It refuses to continue if this isn't Arch, if sudo isn't authenticated, or if there's no network. Before touching anything.": "Es nega a continuar si aix\u00f2 no \u00e9s Arch, si el sudo no est\u00e0 autenticat o si no hi ha xarxa. Abans de tocar res.",
