  "The wallpaper daemon needs to know which Wayland socket the compositor is on. If the variable is not set it falls back to <code>wayland-0</code>, finds nothing, and paints zero outputs \u2014 silently, and with a log line that says it worked. See <a href=\"#hyprland/doctor\">the doctor</a>.": "El dimoni del fons de pantalla necessita saber en quin socket Wayland \u00e9s el compositor. Si la variable no est\u00e0 posada, cau al <code>wayland-0</code>, no hi troba res i no pinta cap sortida \u2014 en silenci, i amb una l\u00ednia de registre que diu que ha funcionat. Mira <a href=\"#hyprland/doctor\">el metge</a>.",
